    "# CircleID ICDAR 2026 - Pen Classification\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**What is this competition?**\n",
    "\n",
    "We are given thousands of scanned PNG images of hand-drawn circles. Each circle was drawn by a different person using one of 8 different pens. Our job is to look at a circle image and predict which pen (numbered 1 to 8) was used to draw it.\n",
    "\n",
    "Think of it like a handwriting expert who can tell just by looking at the ink whether someone used a ballpoint pen, a fountain pen, or a felt-tip marker except here a neural network learns to do that automatically.\n",
    "\n",
    "The test set contains circles drawn by writers the model has never seen before. So the model cannot just memorise which writer uses which pen. It must learn the actual visual texture and thickness of each pen's ink stroke."
   ]
  },
